#: ../../source/docs/common-vrgimbal.rst:11 88d5ea21009f4cc19a246955851a9544
msgid ""
"This article explains how to set up and configure the VR Gimbal 3 Axes "
"Brushless Gimbal Controller for use with ArduPilot."
msgstr "本文介绍如何为 ArduPilot 配置和设置 VR Gimbal 三轴无刷云台控制器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vrgimbal.rst:15 e37945e17e9d4d83832be6e4eefa3206
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vrgimbal.rst:17 4efb9858736d46e0ac33308d83dfff5e
msgid ""
"The `VRGimbal <https://vrgimbal.wordpress.com/>`__ (`2-axis "
"<http://www.virtualrobotix.it/index.php/en/shop/gimbal-control-"
"board/vrgimbal-2-axis-detail>`__ and `3-axis "
"<http://www.virtualrobotix.it/index.php/en/shop/gimbal-control-"
"board/vrgimbal-3-axis-detail>`__ available) began as a fork of the open "
"source `Martinez 2-axis brushless gimbal controller "
"<https://sourceforge.net/projects/brushless-gimbal-brugi/>`__ to support the"
" more powerful STM32 CPUs but since then has been mostly rewritten and "
"includes significant enhancements including 3-axis support and MAVLink for "
"serial communication with the autopilot or ground station."
msgstr ""
"`VRGimbal <https://vrgimbal.wordpress.com/>`__（提供 `2 轴 "
"<http://www.virtualrobotix.it/index.php/en/shop/gimbal-control-"
"board/vrgimbal-2-axis-detail>`__ 和 `3 轴 "
"<http://www.virtualrobotix.it/index.php/en/shop/gimbal-control-"
"board/vrgimbal-3-axis-detail>`__ 版本）最初是开源 `Martinez 2 轴无刷云台控制器 "
"<https://sourceforge.net/projects/brushless-gimbal-brugi/>`__ 的分支，用以支持更强大的 "
"STM32 CPU，此后经过大量重写并包含重大改进，包括 3 轴支持以及通过 MAVLink 与飞控或地面站进行串口通信。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vrgimbal.rst:27 6dcfd10c352445a6bef046c90b71128a
msgid ""
"`Official quick start guide can be found here "
"<https://vrgimbal.wordpress.com/quick-start-guide/>`__"
msgstr "`官方快速入门指南 <https://vrgimbal.wordpress.com/quick-start-guide/>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vrgimbal.rst:28 8f1d8b0b215e499f92fc7308dd2ae3ca
msgid ""
"`Code can be found here "
"<https://code.google.com/archive/p/vrgimbal/source>`__"
msgstr "`代码仓库 <https://code.google.com/archive/p/vrgimbal/source>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vrgimbal.rst:29 5c57f14691284f8cb246cd8114edb97c
msgid "Hardware schematics coming soon"
msgstr "硬件原理图即将发布"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vrgimbal.rst:36 a5aea5f592e74a3f8554bcdf9c2e3db6
msgid ""
"We do not yet have an recommended affordable 3-axis gimbal for use with the "
"VRGimbal.  Testing by the ArduPilot dev team has so far been limited to "
"using a Tarot 2-axis gimbal."
msgstr "目前尚无推荐的与 VRGimbal 配套使用的经济实惠三轴云台。ArduPilot 开发团队的测试目前仅限于 Tarot 两轴云台。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vrgimbal.rst:41 48d945f4261e48998753b604cee39504
msgid "Connecting the VRGimbal to the Pixhawk"
msgstr "将 VRGimbal 连接到 Pixhawk"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vrgimbal.rst:46 dc297c9d83834bf6b7df6f98db6483e5
msgid ""
"The IMU Sensor should be attached to the top or bottom of the camera so that"
" the white arrow points forward."
msgstr "IMU 传感器应安装在相机顶部或底部，白色箭头朝前。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vrgimbal.rst:49 7bd8966596944bb6aa8d6e9747eec324
msgid ""
"The Gimbal controller's red and black power wires should be connected "
"directly to a 3S or 4S battery."
msgstr "云台控制器的红、黑电源线应直接连接到 3S 或 4S 电池。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vrgimbal.rst:52 afbdb14ce1624a769b574bf572ebe039
msgid ""
"The Pitch, Roll and Yaw (if present) gimbal motors should be connected to "
"MOT1, MOT2 and MOT3 respectively."
msgstr "俯仰（Pitch）、横滚（Roll）和偏航（Yaw，如有）云台电机应分别连接到 MOT1、MOT2 和 MOT3。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vrgimbal.rst:55 0aa7c203afd9424db605deebcdd2d7cb
msgid ""
"The \"RC2\" pin (label on the underside of the board) should be connected to"
" the Pixhawk's AUX OUT 1 signal pin (see image above)."
msgstr "「RC2」引脚（位于板底部标签处）应连接到 Pixhawk 的 AUX OUT 1 信号引脚（见上图）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vrgimbal.rst:58 29fc83d8053647edaaf7d030f0bee1fe
msgid ""
"The gound pin which is on the edge of the board near \"RC2\" should be "
"connected to the Pixhawk's AUX OUT 1 \"-\" pin (see image above)."
msgstr "板子边缘靠近「RC2」处的接地引脚应连接到 Pixhawk 的 AUX OUT 1「-」引脚（见上图）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vrgimbal.rst:62 7a1deb9f4e49445996e0ece2f808f2ad
msgid "Operation"
msgstr "操作"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vrgimbal.rst:64 ca43ecbea6e947b8a0bc74cbc80a6cce
msgid ""
"Upon powering the gimbal, the green power light (bottom right in the image "
"above) should turn on immediately.  The gimbal should not be touched within "
"the first 10seconds after start-up as it will be performing an IMU "
"calibration.  Once the calibration is done the red LED (immediately left of "
"the green LED) will come on and the controller will attempt to stabilize the"
" cmaera."
msgstr ""
"云台上电后，绿色电源指示灯（上图右下角）应立即亮起。上电后 10 秒内请勿触碰云台，因为此时正在执行 IMU 校准。校准完成后，红色 LED（紧靠绿色 "
"LED 左侧）将亮起，控制器将尝试稳定相机。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vrgimbal.rst:71 e5ad9c3bd3974a428cebb2ffaf965549
msgid "**LED meanings**"
msgstr "**LED 含义**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vrgimbal.rst:73 629902bdd46b44a4980592378ae7622e
msgid "Solid Green LED = power on"
msgstr "绿色 LED 常亮 = 已上电"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vrgimbal.rst:75 e7bcb1e94f504a6d9901875663ceb636
msgid "Solid Red LED = calibration complete, stabilizing camera"
msgstr "红色 LED 常亮 = 校准完成，正在稳定相机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vrgimbal.rst:78 477fc2af23f64c3d85e955a66bacde05
msgid "Configuring the gimbal"
msgstr "配置云台"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vrgimbal.rst:80 d5cb5e6d2ae44d1dbf8a7213e55c657f
msgid ""
"Use a mini USB cable to connect the Gimbal board to your computer (Windows "
"only?). If this is the first time you have plugged in the dongle you will "
"see a USB device installation window but it will likely fail (see \"BAD\" "
"device driver screen shot below)."
msgstr ""
"使用 mini USB 线将云台板连接到电脑（仅限 Windows？）。如果是首次插入，您将看到 USB "
"设备安装窗口，但安装可能失败（参见下方「BAD」设备驱动截图）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vrgimbal.rst:85 bb3a5842fd714055a0b12dc0bc7451a9
msgid "To update the Maple driver:"
msgstr "更新 Maple 驱动："

#: ../../source/docs/common-vrgimbal.rst:87 00275ed20d644402bcf3bd7c356f2c91
msgid ""
"Download the latest driver from `here "
"<http://www.radionav.it/virtualrobotix/fwtools/maple_usb_serial_win.zip>`__ "
"and unzip it to somewhere convenient on your computer"
msgstr ""
"从 `此处 "
"<http://www.radionav.it/virtualrobotix/fwtools/maple_usb_serial_win.zip>`__ "
"下载最新驱动，解压到电脑上方便的位置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vrgimbal.rst:90 d3bfa24ada304178b22b78bc4f6d2033
msgid ""
"In the device manager, right-mouse-button-click on the Maple driver and "
"select \"Update Driver Software\", then \"Browse my computer for driver "
"software\" and select the folder where you unzipped the driver.  Windows 8 "
"machines may complain because the driver is not signed, instructions are "
"`here <https://www.makeuseof.com/tag/how-can-i-install-hardware-with-"
"unsigned-drivers-in-windows-8/>`__ on how to get around this."
msgstr ""
"在设备管理器中，右键单击 Maple 驱动并选择「更新驱动程序软件」，然后选择「浏览我的计算机以查找驱动程序软件」并选择解压驱动的文件夹。Windows"
" 8 可能会因驱动未签名而报错，`此处 <https://www.makeuseof.com/tag/how-can-i-install-"
"hardware-with-unsigned-drivers-in-windows-8/>`__ 提供了绕过方法。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vrgimbal.rst:97 d3f703249e98401e9fbe576270d8bf02
msgid ""
"After the driver is installed, if the Maple device appears as COM9 or higher"
" you will not be able to connect.  The Control Panel's Device Manager can be"
" used to reassign the comport to the COM1 ~ COM8 range."
msgstr ""
"驱动安装完成后，如果 Maple 设备出现为 COM9 或更高端口，则无法连接。可通过控制面板的设备管理器将串口重新分配到 COM1～COM8 范围。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vrgimbal.rst:105 d537c5ca97ef4af0aaa06431c00a4014
msgid ""
"Download and run the latest VRGimbal UI installation .msi file by going to "
"the `VRGimbal wordpress site and select the top item from the Downloads menu"
" <https://vrgimbal.wordpress.com/download/>`__.  At the time this wiki page "
"was written it was `version 1.13 "
"<https://vrgimbal.wordpress.com/download/vrgimbal-1-13-2/>`__. After "
"installation the \"VRGimbal GUI\" should appear in your start menu."
msgstr ""
"访问 `VRGimbal WordPress 网站并从下载菜单中选择最新项 "
"<https://vrgimbal.wordpress.com/download/>`__，下载并运行最新的 VRGimbal UI 安装 .msi "
"文件。撰写本 wiki 页面时版本为 `1.13 "
"<https://vrgimbal.wordpress.com/download/vrgimbal-1-13-2/>`__。安装完成后，「VRGimbal"
" GUI」应出现在开始菜单中。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vrgimbal.rst:110 944a67c570c343b687233bf7dc4328f3
msgid "Start the VRGimbal GUI from the start menu."
msgstr "从开始菜单启动 VRGimbal GUI。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vrgimbal.rst:115 d43a8e6f230843c18d92b3c5bf8c2162
msgid "Connect the gimbal to your computer with the mini USB cable"
msgstr "用 mini USB 线将云台连接到电脑"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vrgimbal.rst:116 3d39e5e745d84f32af9b26e3e8630fa5
msgid "On the VRGimbalGUI select the COM port and press the **Open** button"
msgstr "在 VRGimbalGUI 中选择 COM 端口，点击 **Open** 按钮"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vrgimbal.rst:117 d502bbf7ad5743389c16c3c60bdd4f5e
msgid ""
"Click on the *Pitch* tab, click the **Absolute** checkbox, press **Send "
"Config** and **Save to Flash** buttons."
msgstr ""
"点击 *Pitch* 选项卡，勾选 **Absolute** 复选框，点击 **Send Config** 和 **Save to Flash** "
"按钮。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vrgimbal.rst:121 b7dab5e2b4cf4ece8b1268541cbc52d0
msgid "Set-up through the mission planner"
msgstr "通过 Mission Planner 进行配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vrgimbal.rst:123 0db15e2c51bb4b0987851f8d498b933f
msgid ""
"The channel 6 tuning knob's output can be used to control the pitch angle of"
" the gimbal by:"
msgstr "可通过以下方式使用 6 通道调参旋钮的输出控制云台俯仰角："

#: ../../source/docs/common-vrgimbal.rst:126 c704fa55fd1641959aeb54f96cebe50f
msgid "Connect the Pixhawk to the mission planner"
msgstr "将 Pixhawk 连接到 Mission Planner"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vrgimbal.rst:127 5171224755434b25bafbd8d49c9e6dce
msgid ""
"Open the **Initial Setup \\| Optional Hardware \\| Camera Gimbal** screen "
"set:"
msgstr "打开 **Initial Setup \\| Optional Hardware \\| Camera Gimbal** 界面并设置："

#: ../../source/docs/common-vrgimbal.rst:130 3aa9b020ce6749d0b1214093280ed948
msgid "Tilt drop-down to RC9 (equivalent to AUX OUT1)"
msgstr "将 Tilt 下拉框设置为 RC9（等同于 AUX OUT1）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vrgimbal.rst:131 e7839cc35de24e7485ba77cb3ee84d99
msgid "Input Ch drop-down to RC6"
msgstr "将 Input Ch 下拉框设置为 RC6"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vrgimbal.rst:132 72188dfaa5a048828cde74a5b761ede9
msgid "The \"Stabilize Tilt\" checkbox should not be checked"
msgstr "「Stabilize Tilt」复选框不应勾选"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vrgimbal.rst:138 088216eef49a4016b116761ff1c93ce6
msgid "Updating the gimbal software"
msgstr "更新云台固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vrgimbal.rst:140 88abc237ec8645aca840afbfae374786
msgid ""
"Please see the `VRGimbal firmware upgrade wordpress site "
"<https://vrgimbal.wordpress.com/quick-start-guide/firmware-upgrade/>`__ for "
"details."
msgstr ""
"详情请参阅 `VRGimbal 固件升级 WordPress 网站 <https://vrgimbal.wordpress.com/quick-"
"start-guide/firmware-upgrade/>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vrgimbal.rst:144 e27eb4b9d02043e1ac921233dbe4fbab
msgid "Common Problems"
msgstr "常见问题"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vrgimbal.rst:146 985bf50d3f624f4c92024e7c5968ddec
msgid ""
"Camera is not level.  Perform the accelerometer calibration as described at "
"the bottom of `this page <https://vrgimbal.wordpress.com/quick-start-"
"guide/configuration-and-calibration/>`__."
msgstr ""
"相机不水平。按照 `此页面 <https://vrgimbal.wordpress.com/quick-start-"
"guide/configuration-and-calibration/>`__ 底部说明执行加速度计校准。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vrgimbal.rst:148 8a32c5f332414e69bfbdd55028da3999
msgid ""
"Small gimbal motors emit a high pitches squeal.  Connect with the "
"VRGimbalGui, Go to the Advanced tab and set the \"PWM frequency\" to High.  "
"Press **Send Config** and **Save to Flash** buttons."
msgstr ""
"小型云台电机发出高频啸叫。连接 VRGimbalGui，进入 Advanced 选项卡，将「PWM frequency」设置为 High，点击 "
"**Send Config** 和 **Save to Flash** 按钮。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vrgimbal.rst:153 8debcfbdf17e496f8c24fca9c28b3aad
msgid "Other Open Source Alternatives"
msgstr "其他开源替代方案"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vrgimbal.rst:155 990bc0e27b074491bf5cdca459814d0e
msgid ""
"`Martinez 2-axis gimbal controllers "
"<https://sourceforge.net/projects/brushless-gimbal-brugi/>`__ using the "
"original AVR328 chip can be found at retailers including `hobbyking "
"<https://hobbyking.com/en_us/2-axis-brushless-camera-gimbal-stabilization-"
"control-board-w-imu.html?___store=en_us>`__."
msgstr ""
"使用原始 AVR328 芯片的 `Martinez 2 轴云台控制器 "
"<https://sourceforge.net/projects/brushless-gimbal-brugi/>`__ 可在 `hobbyking "
"<https://hobbyking.com/en_us/2-axis-brushless-camera-gimbal-stabilization-"
"control-board-w-imu.html?___store=en_us>`__ 等零售商处购得。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vrgimbal.rst:159 769970fe3d0c4e899ca77a363097d0ab
msgid ""
"`OlliW's STorM3 BGC 3-Axis STM32 based brushless gimbal controller "
"<http://www.olliw.eu/2013/storm32bgc/?en>`__ is open source hardware, closed"
" source (but free) gimbal firmware and open source windows configuration UI."
msgstr ""
"`OlliW 的 STorM3 BGC 三轴 STM32 无刷云台控制器 "
"<http://www.olliw.eu/2013/storm32bgc/?en>`__ 是开源硬件，闭源（但免费）云台固件以及开源 Windows "
"配置界面。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vrgimbal.rst:163 25c47e5a91dd4daa94fb10f0b5f132e8
msgid ""
"Questions about the VRGimbal? Post to the `VRGimbal User group "
"<http://www.virtualrobotix.com/group/vr-gimbal-user-group>`__ (not directly "
"associated with the DIYDrones or 3dRobotics)"
msgstr ""
"关于 VRGimbal 的问题？请发帖至 `VRGimbal 用户组 <http://www.virtualrobotix.com/group/vr-"
"gimbal-user-group>`__（与 DIYDrones 或 3dRobotics 无直接关联）"
